<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> January 2026</p>
<h2>Our Commitment</h2>
<p>OnlinePDFPro is built with privacy as its foundation. We believe your documents belong to you and only you.</p>
<h2>Data Processing</h2>
<p>Processing methods vary by tool and are described on each tool page. Check those details before uploading a document.</p>
<h2>What We Collect</h2>
<p>We use basic analytics to understand site usage patterns. No personal information is collected, stored, or shared.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We use Cloudflare for CDN and security. Standard anonymized analytics may be collected by our hosting provider.</p>
<h2>Support</h2>
<p>Questions about this policy? Email us at support@onlinepdfpro.com.</p>
